# #1211 dep-refresh analysis artifacts (post-hoc reconstruction of the
# upstream audit + upgrade-analysis that fed the issue body).
# Allow the file types this investigation produces (CSV summary, shell runner,
# markdown findings, per-iteration test logs, grep-output text files). Avoids
# per-file allowlist churn as Phases 3-7 add more findings + logs.
# #1121 SPA workflow chain investigation produces markdown synthesis notes only
